1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,010
How many cards did the writer send?
作者寄了多少张明信片？

2
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:17,440
How many cards did the writer send?
作者寄了多少张明信片？

3
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:23,340
Postcards always spoil my holidays.
明信片总是搅得我假日不得安宁。

4
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:26,800
Last summer, I went to Italy.
去年夏天，我去了意大利。

5
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:31,650
I visited museums and sat in public gardens.
我参观了博物馆，还去了公园。

6
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:36,450
A friendly waiter taught me a few words of Italian.
一位好客的服务员教了我几句意大利语。

7
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:38,640
Then he lent me a book.
之后，他借给我一本书。

8
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:41,100
I read a few lines,
我读了几行，

9
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:44,420
but I did not understand a word.
但一个字也不懂。

10
00:00:45,750 --> 00:00:47,880
Everyday I thought about postcards.
我每天都想着明信片的事。

11
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:50,920
My holidays passed quickly,
假期过得很快，

12
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:54,200
but I did not send cards to my friends.
可我还没有给我的朋友们寄过一张明信片。

13
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:59,050
On the last day I made a big decision.
到了最后一天，我作出了一项重大决定。

14
00:00:59,890 --> 00:01:04,910
I got up early and bought thirty-seven cards.
我早早起了床，买来了37张明信片。

15
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:09,390
I spent the whole day in my room,
我在房间里整整待了一天，

16
00:01:09,470 --> 00:01:13,580
but I did not write a single card!
然而竟连一张明信片也没写成！
